    new "我会给你发短信！"

    # game/chapters/01/ch_01_05.rpy:75
    old "I guess I could browse some more news or just wait until [lucy.ColoredName] texts me back..."
    new "我想我可以再浏览一些新闻，或者等到[lucy.ColoredName]给我回短信……"

    # game/chapters/01/ch_01_05.rpy:75
    old "Show me more of this cruel world..."
    new "让我看看这个残酷的世界……"

    # game/chapters/01/ch_01_05.rpy:75
    old "I'll just wait for [lucy.ColoredName]'s message."
    new "我就等[lucy.ColoredName]的消息。"

    # game/chapters/01/ch_01_05.rpy:100
    old "I'll be there in about 10 minutes. See you in your room!"
    new "我大约10分钟后到。在你房间见！"

    # game/chapters/01/ch_01_05.rpy:103
    old "Can't wait!"
    new "等不及了！"

